# Repository-root ignores.
#
# The application has its own .gitignore inside cdm-student-website-main/.
# This file covers everything that lives at the repo ROOT — which previously
# left files such as cookies.txt (an exported cookie jar) unprotected, because
# the app-level .gitignore does not reach up here.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
cookies.txt
*.log
logs/
node_modules/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
backups/
.vercel
*.tmp
